<%= render partial: "layouts/head" %>

<div class="top-cta-wrap">
	<div class="container top-cta-container">
		<div class="row col-xs-12">
			<h1>Real time</b>, embeddable, social feeds.</h1>
			<h2>Starting at <b><span class="small-text">$</span>19 <span class="small-text">a month</span></b></h2>
			<a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/register">Start your <b>45 day</b> trial</a><br>
			<a href="/#features" class="find-out-more">Find out more</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="container">
	
	<div class="row clearfix steps">
		
		<div class="step">
			<img src="/images/connect.png" alt="">
			<h2>Connect</h2>
			<p>Connect the content that you produce accross multiple networks.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="step">
			<img src="/images/moderate.png" alt="">
			<h2>Moderate</h2>
			<p>Set up the moderation rules to keep your content focused.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="step">
			<img src="/images/embed.png" alt="">
			<h2>Embed</h2>
			<p>Easily embed your customized feed to  your website or on any HTML page.</p>
		</div>

	</div>
</div>

<div class="blue-cta">
	<div class="container">
		<p>
			Combine in a unified feed the content that you produce across networks.
			<b>Build your social proof, and strengthen your community!</b>
		</p>
		<a href="/register">Get Started</a>
	</div>
</div>

<div class="container last-container">
	<div class="features" id="features">
		<div class="feature-left row">
			<div class="image-wrap col-xs-5 col-xs-offset-1">
				<img src="/images/networks.png" alt="">
			</div>
			<div class="col-xs-5">
				<h2>Connect</h2>
				<h3>Aggregate everything!</h3>
				<p>
					BitHub has a powerful aggregation engine which allows you to collect all your content.
				</p>
				<p>
					Twitter, Facebook and Tumblr are just some of the content sources we support. No matter if it’s text, image or video, we can display it in your feed. All of this works in real time.
				</p>
			</div>
			
			
		</div>
		<div class="feature-right row">
			<div class="col-xs-5 col-xs-offset-1">
				<h2>Moderate</h2>
				<h3>Your content, your rules.</h3>
				<p>
					Every item we collect is automatically moderated based on the rules you set up. 
				</p>
				<p>
					You can block profanities, or filter the data related to some subject. BitHub puts you in the control of data.
				</p>
				<p>
					Besides the automatic moderation, you can manually moderate any item.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="image-wrap col-xs-5">
				<img src="/images/approve_block.png" alt="">
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="feature-left row">
			<div class="image-wrap col-xs-5 col-xs-offset-1">
				<img src="/images/design_embed.png" alt="">
			</div>
			<div class="col-xs-5">
				<h2>Embed</h2>
				<h3>Embed on any page.</h3>
				<p>
					BitHub allows you to adjust it’s design so it fits in your branding.
				</p>
				<p>
					All content cards are designed to work in both full page and small area context which allows you to reuse your embeds across your site.
				</p>
				<p>
					Pick your layout and theme, and just paste the code into your HTML page and you’re ready to go.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div id="#goregister" class="row cta">
		<a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn lg">Start your 45 day trial &#8594;</a>
	</div>
</div>

<%= render partial: "layouts/footer" %>
